# Ignore rendered output from Git but not videos you import into src/.
# (renamed from out/). Lowercase to match the actual directory name —
# the capitalised "Infographics" only worked by accident on this machine's
# case-insensitive filesystem (core.ignorecase=true); a case-sensitive
# clone (Linux CI, case-sensitive macOS) would have tracked every render.
infographics/
